Modifications
=============

Alviss is developed independently from Plainva, starting from the v0.8.7
release (commit 423752705, released 2026-11-04). This notice records the
modification as AGPL-3.0 section 5(a) requires.

Modifications started on 2026-11-14 and continue after that date:

  - rebranded to Alviss: product name, application icon, bundle identifier
    (com.alviss.desktop), update feed and update signing key
  - added an in-app LLM chat, written for Alviss
  - restricted the offered user-interface languages to English and Simplified
    Chinese

See git history for the complete record.


Trademarks
==========

The name "Plainva", the Plainva logo and the plainva.com domain belong to their
owners. Alviss does not use them as brand assets and is not affiliated with,
endorsed by, or supported by the Plainva project.

References to Plainva in this repository are descriptive: they identify where
the code came from and document file-format compatibility.

Where the code keeps the `plainva:` YAML frontmatter namespace, the `.plainva/`
folder inside a vault, the `plainva.db` database file name and the `@plainva/*`
package names, the reason is compatibility with existing vaults and with
Obsidian, and keeping merges from upstream reviewable. That is descriptive use,
not a claim to the mark.
